# Annotated Equations

A labelled annotated equation binds a part of the formula to a class:
:mathblock:
  {:label: eqn-ann}
  \class{lk lk-a}{a} \le b
::

We refer to :ref:eqn-ann::.

A trust-gated command other than \class stays untrusted:
:mathblock:
  {:label: eqn-href}
  \href{https://example.com}{a}
::
